{
  "title": "VPN / Direct Connect · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "온프레미스와 AWS를 연결하는 두 대표 경로다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> / Direct Connect</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Customer Gateway and Virtual Private Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect\">Direct Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#dedicated-and-hosted-connections\">Dedicated and Hosted Connections</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\">Public, Private and Transit VIF</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect-gateway\">Direct Connect Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#encryption-and-resilience\">Encryption and Resilience</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>60 / 62</span></div><h1>VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> / Direct Connect</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Hybrid Connectivity는 On-premises Network와 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Network를 연결하는 설계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>은 암호화 Tunnel을, Direct Connect는 전용 연결 경로를 제공한다.</p><p>대역폭, 예측 가능한 지연, 설치 기간, 암호화, 장애 복구 요구에 따라 조합한다. 전용 회선이라는 이유만으로 데이터가 기본적으로 암호화된다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"VPN과 Direct Connect\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>VPN과 Direct Connect</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Site-to-Site VPN</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>On-premises gateway</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Customer Gateway</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>IPsec tunnels</strong><small>인터넷 기반 암호화</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">VGW</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 연결</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Direct Connect</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>On-premises network</strong><small>전용 회선 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Direct Connect location</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\">VIF</a>·BGP 구성</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> network</strong><small>암호화·이중화 별도 설계</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">전용 연결과 Encryption은 다른 요구다. 장애 시 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> Backup 등을 함께 검토한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"site-to-site-vpn\"><h2>Site-to-Site VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Customer Gateway</a> 장치와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Virtual Private Gateway</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> 사이에 IPsec Tunnel을 만든다. 보통 인터넷을 이용하므로 빠르게 구성할 수 있지만 인터넷 경로의 품질 영향을 받는다. 한 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> Connection에는 두 Tunnel이 제공되어 두 경로 사용과 장치 이중화를 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\"><h2>Customer Gateway and Virtual Private Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Customer Gateway</a>는 고객 측 장치 정보를 나타내고 실제 Router가 Tunnel을 종료한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Virtual Private Gateway</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 연결에 사용하는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 측 Gateway다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 연결을 중앙화할 때는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"direct-connect\"><h2>Direct Connect<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>고객 위치에서 Direct Connect Location을 거쳐 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 전용 연결한다. 인터넷 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span>보다 일관된 경로·대역폭을 목표로 하지만 설치·파트너 준비가 필요하다. 회선 하나는 장애에 대비한 이중 경로가 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dedicated-and-hosted-connections\"><h2>Dedicated and Hosted Connections<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#dedicated-and-hosted-connections\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#dedicated-and-hosted-connections\">Dedicated Connection</a>은 고객에게 제공하는 전용 Physical Ethernet 연결이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#dedicated-and-hosted-connections\">Hosted Connection</a>은 Partner가 제공하는 연결이다. 속도·기능·주문 조건을 비교하고 위치가 다른 연결을 사용해 공통 장애를 줄인다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"public-private-and-transit-vif\"><h2>Public, Private and Transit VIF <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Interface)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\">Public VIF</a>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Public Endpoint, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\">Private VIF</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 관련 Private 연결, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#public-private-and-transit-vif\">Transit VIF</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect-gateway\">Direct Connect Gateway</a>를 통한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> 연결에 사용한다. 이름의 Public은 반드시 인터넷을 경유한다는 뜻이 아니다. VLAN과 BGP 구성을 맞춘다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"direct-connect-gateway\"><h2>Direct Connect Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Direct Connect를 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> Gateway 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>와 연결하는 논리 구성 요소다. Gateway 자체를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 간 Transit Router로 이해하면 안 된다. 연결 대상과 Allowed <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> 정책을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption-and-resilience\"><h2>Encryption and Resilience<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#encryption-and-resilience\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Direct Connect의 기본 데이터 전송에 IPsec 암호화를 자동 가정하지 않는다. 필요하면 지원 MACsec 또는 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> over Direct Connect를 선택한다. 별도 위치의 연결과 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> Backup 등으로 장애 경로를 준비한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>본사와 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 간 안정적인 대량 전송은 이중 Direct Connect로 구성하고, 암호화가 필요하면 지원 방식으로 보호하며 VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span>을 Backup 경로로 둘 수 있다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>사설 연결과 전송 암호화 요구사항을 분리해서 읽는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpn/latest/s2svpn/VPC_VPN.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpn/latest/s2svpn/VPC_VPN.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/aws-vpc-connectivity-options/aws-direct-connect.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">whitepapers/latest/aws-vpc-connectivity-options/aws-direct-connect.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q020\" data-question=\"Q020\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q020</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a central hub to connect dozens of VPCs and on-premises networks. Which service is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>가 다수 네트워크의 중앙 연결과 라우팅에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q021\" data-question=\"Q021\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q021</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q021/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs a dedicated network connection from its premises to AWS and will handle encryption separately. Which service should it consider?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q021\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q021\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 TTL settings</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q021\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Direct Connect</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q021\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">Direct Connect</a>는 전용 네트워크 연결이다. 전송 암호화는 별도 방식을 설계해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q022\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q094\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q019\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A&#x27;s security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC Peering</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">다음 용어 <b>WAF / Shield</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
